<!--
  App.3 sign-page catalogue: every registered Appendix 3 page. key is the canonical
  sign-page reference (e.g. "G02.1"); family is the layout token consumed by the
  layout/CLI/app layers; scheme must resolve against palettes.xml.
  18 guidance (G) + 23 information (I) + 21 warning (W) + 33 regulatory (R) pages = 95
  entries. The warning triangles were registered in S8; the regulatory family (prohibitory
  discs, mandatory blue discs, the Stop octagon and the Give-Way point-down triangle) in S9;
  Supplementary is authored in S10 and only then added, so the shipped catalog lists real
  Uganda pages only (no placeholder tiles that would render a not-yet-drawn sign).
-->
